# /settings' Fast mode and Ultra mode on anthropic/claude-opus-5 -- a model
# that offers Fast and not Ultra (`models.json`): Fast's row has `off  on`
# and Right is `/fast`; Ultra's is its value alone and Right does nothing.
# fx's harness launches it with FX_SOUND=0; xfx is given the same start.
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
models models.json
seed fast-seed-opus.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1.5
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.3
snap fast-marked
key Right
wait 1
snap fast-on
wait 1
home fast-on
key Down
wait 0.3
key Right
wait 1
snap ultra-right
key Up
wait 0.3
key Left
wait 1
snap fast-off
key Escape
wait 0.5
